<title>CZECH REPUBLIC: Czech posts CZK 144.9 mln 9mo gross.</title>
<headline>Czech posts CZK 144.9 mln 9mo gross.</headline>
<dateline>PRAGUE 1996-11-12</dateline>
<text>
<p>Results for nine month period ending September 30, 1996: (in millions of crowns)</p>
<p> Gross profit	   144.9    vs    172.9</p>
<p> Operational profit   185.9    vs    205.1</p>
<p> Production	   1,043.4    vs    912.8</p>
<p> Sales		  1,021.97   vs    899.7</p>
<p> Write-offs	     307.1    vs    252.5</p>
<p> Assets		 3,676.4    vs  3,484.9</p>
<p> Basic capital	2,259.4    vs  2,259.5</p>
<p>Note. Full company name is Ceske Radiokomunikace a.s. . All results are preliminary. The firm is a radio signal transmitter.</p>
<p>-- Prague Newsroom, 42-2-2423-0003</p>
</text>
